flowchart TB
  Developer[Developer push] --> Actions[GitHub Actions]
  Actions -->|test and build| GHCR[GHCR image]
  Actions -->|SSH deploy| Compose[Docker Compose on VPS]
  GHCR --> Compose

  Browser[Browser] -->|HTTPS and HTMX| Nginx[nginx]
  Nginx -->|SSR and partial requests| Astro[Astro + Node]
  Astro -->|HTML + Preact island| Browser

  Astro --> Guards[Upload guards]
  Guards --> ONNX[ONNX Runtime + MobileNetV2]
  ONNX --> Sharp[Sharp image pipeline]
  Sharp --> Uploads[(Uploads volume)]
  Nginx -->|serve WebP directly| Uploads

  Astro --> Drizzle[Drizzle ORM]
  Drizzle --> SQLite[(SQLite WAL)]
  SQLite --> Litestream[Litestream]
  Uploads --> Rclone[rclone]
  Litestream --> R2[(Cloudflare R2)]
  Rclone --> R2
  Certbot[Certbot] -->|TLS certificates| Nginx
  Compose -. manages .-> Nginx
  Compose -. manages .-> Astro
  Compose -. manages .-> Litestream
  Compose -. manages .-> Rclone